      "name": "Sniper Rifle (Powered, Deadeye Stabilizer)",
      "type": "weapon",
      "img": "modules/cyberpunk-5e/assets/weapon_icons/firearm_icons/sniper_rifle.png",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Ranged Weapon Attack: +8 to hit, range 200/800 ft., one target. Hit: 12 (2d8 + 3) piercing damage and 2 (1d4) lightning damage. This weapon has the heavy, reload (6), sighted, two-handed properties.</p><p><strong>Power Shot.</strong> The weapon adds half the wielder's DEX modifier (rounded up) to damage.</p><p><strong>Deadeye Stabilizer.</strong> If the sniper hasn't moved during this turn, it can brace before attacking. Until the end of the turn, when it hits with a ranged attack using this weapon, it can roll the weapon's damage dice twice and use either total. Bracing reduces its speed to 0 until the end of the current turn.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "book": "Technomancer's Textbook",
          "page": "217"
        },
